      "title": "[New Atlas] Cubic camper trailer gets vertical to maximize post-adventure living",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3342b31/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1280x672+0+24/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4a%2F33%2F27a1f8a042e2903182e564299eda%2Fsylvansport-vire-3-4-2118-1280x720-1.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3342b31/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1280x672+0+24/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4a%2F33%2F27a1f8a042e2903182e564299eda%2Fsylvansport-vire-3-4-2118-1280x720-1.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3342b31/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1280x672+0+24/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4a%2F33%2F27a1f8a042e2903182e564299eda%2Fsylvansport-vire-3-4-2118-1280x720-1.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3342b31/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1280x672+0+24/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4a%2F33%2F27a1f8a042e2903182e564299eda%2Fsylvansport-vire-3-4-2118-1280x720-1.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3342b31/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1280x672+0+24/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4a%2F33%2F27a1f8a042e2903182e564299eda%2Fsylvansport-vire-3-4-2118-1280x720-1.jpg&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p><img alt=\"SylvanSport fills some of the gap space in its lineup with the new Vire camping trailer\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d9f66f6/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1280x720+0+0/resize/1280x720!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4a%2F33%2F27a1f8a042e2903182e564299eda%2Fsylvansport-vire-3-4-2118-1280x720-1.jpg\" /><p>SylvanSport has long lurked as an outlier in the RV world. For years, its primary offerings were skeletal gear-hauling tent trailers unlike virtually anything else on the market. It then leaped from that compact, lightweight low-rider style straight to launching one of the boldest, boxiest campers of its class in the expandable Vast. Now it's circling back to fill in some of the sprawling space in between, launching the all-new Vire trailer as a camper that's just as boxy as the Vast but smaller and simpler. The new camper packs everything you need for a great weekend in the wild, without anything to complicate the trip.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/camping-trailers/sylvansport-vire-camper-cube-trailer/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/camping-trailers/\">Camping Trailers</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/adventure-vehicles/\">Adventure Vehicles</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/\">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/trailers/\" rel=\"tag\">trailers</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/caravan/\" rel=\"tag\">Caravan</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/sylvansport/\" rel=\"tag\">Sylvansport</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/rv/\" rel=\"tag\">RV</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/trailer/\" rel=\"tag\">Trailer</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/\" rel=\"tag\">Camping</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/outdoor/\" rel=\"tag\">Outdoors and Camping</a></p>",
